THE ONE LEG THAT MOVES IS A TRANSPORT TIMEOUT, not a verdict about the
deployed code -- and it moved to COULD NOT RUN, never to VERIFIED. That is
the direction a flaky leg has to fail in, and it is why the probe has three
states. ACCURACY AND STABILITY ARE TWO NUMBERS (cross-domain discipline:
report them separately, never as one).
